<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-BA CONSIDERS MILAN MOVE.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BA CONSIDERS MILAN MOVE.</headline>
<dateline>BORDEAUX 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bordeaux international midfielder Ibrahim Ba said on Thursday he considers a move to AC Milan as a &quot;serious option&quot;.</p>
<p>Ba was replying to a report that he had actually signed a four-year deal with the Italian club.</p>
<p>A Bordeaux spokesman said: &quot;We want to remind everybody that Ibrahim Ba is still under contract with us and so far we haven't had any contacts with the AC Milan.&quot;</p>
</text>
